! An alpha magnet in two halves with a puck scraper and momentum slits on the first and position slits
! on another: the matrices through track_particles() on the device, the filters as kernels with the
! CPU's float limits and swap order. Must be identical
Q1: QUAD, L=0.1, K1=0.5
D: DRIF, L=0.2
A1: ALPH, XMAX=0.1206, PART=1, XPUCK=0.12058, WIDTHPUCK=4e-5, DP1=-0.0015, DP2=0.002, ORDER=2
A2: ALPH, XMAX=0.1206, PART=2, ORDER=2
A3: ALPH, XMAX=0.1206, PART=1, XS1=0.12054, XS2=0.12065, ORDER=2
A4: ALPH, XMAX=0.1206, PART=2, ORDER=2
BL: LINE=(Q1, D, A1, A2, D, A3, A4, D)
